{
  "comment": "V2 UI kit (Figma 'Callbreak Game UI', page 'V2 · Design System', section 'Unity Export'). Sizes and borders are 1920x1080 canvas units; sprites are exported at 2x (pixels per unit 200). 'nine' is left, top, right, bottom. Faces come from the export sheet; shadows are rendered from the V2 drop-shadow effects (Figma blur radius = 2 sigma).",
  "scale": 2,
  "ppu": 200,
  "faces": [
    { "id": "panel_large", "outs": ["UI/Panels/UI_Panel_Large.png"], "nine": [100, 100, 100, 100] },
